WEBVTT

00:13.596 --> 00:16.516
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes,

00:16.599 --> 00:20.103
west longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

00:21.062 --> 00:23.940
Wait for the next new moon.

00:24.566 --> 00:28.153
Heaven will appear then.

00:28.653 --> 00:31.114
I have no use for this place now.

00:31.614 --> 00:35.577
The birthed creature now belongs to me.

00:36.077 --> 00:38.038
Jailhouse Lock.

00:38.121 --> 00:41.291
You can only remember
three new pieces of information.

00:41.875 --> 00:43.668
What do I need to do?

00:43.752 --> 00:45.211
What's important to me?

00:45.295 --> 00:47.255
What shouldn't I forget?

00:47.839 --> 00:51.426
I have things I need to tell Jolyne!

00:55.138 --> 00:58.475
What am I doing here?

00:59.559 --> 01:02.187
Something's off.

01:07.942 --> 01:12.864
What? Why is this man
going inside the house?

01:12.947 --> 01:14.949
I have no idea what's going on.

01:15.033 --> 01:16.576
Bitch!

01:16.659 --> 01:18.787
Stop rewinding it so much!

01:18.870 --> 01:21.456
No shit, now I'm lost too!

01:21.539 --> 01:23.458
Get this bitch out of here!

01:24.501 --> 01:27.045
Fine, I'll leave.

01:29.714 --> 01:33.468
Greenie, that's the head honcho of
all the other spiders in this cell.

01:33.551 --> 01:37.931
Hello sir, great to meet you.

01:38.014 --> 01:40.391
I'm Pit Viper Ron.

01:40.475 --> 01:43.102
Yes, good to meet you.

01:44.103 --> 01:46.606
And this spider right here's
about to croak.

01:46.689 --> 01:49.067
Oh, hey.

01:49.859 --> 01:51.027
The hell?

01:51.110 --> 01:54.030
What's funny about it?

01:54.114 --> 01:56.950
I don't get this comic at all.

01:57.033 --> 02:01.496
Oh, why did I come to
this recreation room?

02:03.206 --> 02:05.375
2. YOU CAN ONLY RETAIN
UP TO THREE NEW PIECES OF INFORMATION

02:05.458 --> 02:07.627
That's right… I'm in a predicament.

02:08.378 --> 02:11.881
I came here to find a way
out of this situation.

02:16.511 --> 02:18.263
The medical wing is beyond this corridor.

02:18.346 --> 02:20.723
The stairs on the way
lead to Emporio's room.

02:20.807 --> 02:22.851
It's usually not a hassle,

02:22.934 --> 02:25.019
but the area is heavily guarded today.

02:25.103 --> 02:27.647
How can I reach Emporio?

02:37.866 --> 02:41.286
IF ANYONE KEEPS LOOKING AT
MY LEFT HAND, DON'T HESITATE

02:41.369 --> 02:44.122
JUST PUNCH

02:49.836 --> 02:50.753
She has a Stand!

02:50.837 --> 02:52.672
It looks familiar too.

02:53.172 --> 02:55.675
I have to chase it. She's my enemy!

02:55.758 --> 02:57.677
She's the Stand User!

04:30.937 --> 04:35.775
EPISODE 24: JAILBREAK…

05:08.224 --> 05:10.310
Where… am I?

05:10.393 --> 05:13.396
And who was I trying to chase just now?

05:13.479 --> 05:14.397
There she is.

05:14.480 --> 05:17.650
- Target found at the corner of D-12-2.
- Hands in the air!

05:18.693 --> 05:21.612
I was wrong, I'm the one being chased!

05:23.906 --> 05:26.492
She's right there! Hey, don't move!

05:33.166 --> 05:34.375
What the…

05:34.459 --> 05:37.462
Was there just one guard
coming from this way?

05:38.046 --> 05:39.964
No, that doesn't matter right now.

05:40.548 --> 05:41.966
Where is this?

05:42.050 --> 05:44.510
Where the hell am I?

05:44.594 --> 05:46.137
Why am I being chased?

06:05.990 --> 06:08.576
Where is she? I swear she ran this way!

06:08.659 --> 06:10.328
Keep looking. We have to find her!

06:10.411 --> 06:11.704
There's no way we lost her.

06:11.788 --> 06:13.539
She must be hiding somewhere close!

06:13.623 --> 06:15.416
She may have ran towards the stairs.

06:15.500 --> 06:16.667
That's not possible.

06:16.751 --> 06:19.087
She would have to walk right past us.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.171
Stairs?

06:20.671 --> 06:22.215
"Go see Emporio…"

06:22.715 --> 06:27.053
That's right, that flight of stairs
leads to Emporio's room.

06:43.402 --> 06:46.155
What's going on?

06:46.823 --> 06:49.700
That's right, I spilled some water.

06:49.784 --> 06:51.953
GO TELL JOLYNE

06:52.620 --> 06:56.374
I have to tell Jolyne.

06:57.667 --> 06:59.293
I have to print something.

06:59.377 --> 07:01.254
We'll end up forgetting it,

07:01.796 --> 07:04.215
so I have to show her the guard's face.

07:04.924 --> 07:07.760
Or else, I can't tell her.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.011
MEW MEW, AGE 25
LEAD GUARD

07:11.597 --> 07:13.182
Jolyne Cujoh.

07:13.850 --> 07:17.103
You can't retain more than
three new pieces of information.

07:17.186 --> 07:19.480
Even if you saw four guards,

07:19.564 --> 07:22.567
you can't remember more
than three of them.

07:22.650 --> 07:26.112
Even though the fourth guard
is in your line of sight,

07:26.195 --> 07:29.365
your brain rejects it
since that's too much to remember.

07:31.409 --> 07:35.580
You wanted to go see Emporio,
so I let you guide me here.

07:35.663 --> 07:36.789
So I see.

07:36.873 --> 07:39.167
I didn't know there was a room here.

07:51.554 --> 07:52.597
Emporio!

07:56.976 --> 07:59.187
Jolyne.

07:59.270 --> 08:01.689
- How long have you been here?
- I got here just now.

08:01.772 --> 08:05.151
Your poor hands. What happened to them?

08:05.902 --> 08:07.320
The writings on your arms…

08:07.403 --> 08:09.363
You can only remember three new things.

08:09.447 --> 08:11.991
You're in the same boat as I am!

08:12.074 --> 08:13.868
Ever since that time
in the confinement cell!

08:13.951 --> 08:17.121
That's right, I was hoping to see you.

08:17.788 --> 08:21.167
I have to tell you something, Jolyne!

08:21.250 --> 08:23.294
What's this? What was I doing just now?

08:25.671 --> 08:27.298
What? Jolyne?

08:27.381 --> 08:28.799
When did you get here?

08:28.883 --> 08:32.595
- And why did you come?
- Right, why am I here?

08:32.678 --> 08:34.305
- Why?
- Why?

08:34.972 --> 08:37.517
Oh, that's right. I'm here to see you.

08:37.600 --> 08:39.268
I don't know what for,

08:39.352 --> 08:42.480
but there was a really serious reason
for me to come see you.

08:42.563 --> 08:43.940
Print it out.

08:44.023 --> 08:45.942
I have to print something out.

08:46.025 --> 08:48.528
If I don't, it'll be forgotten forever.

08:48.611 --> 08:50.404
Printing is the only way to remember it.

08:50.488 --> 08:52.406
Print what out, Emporio?

08:52.490 --> 08:54.450
What are you talking about?

08:54.534 --> 08:57.870
Huh? But how would I do that?

08:57.954 --> 09:01.123
What was I trying to print out?

09:02.166 --> 09:05.795
"Mew Mew, Lead Guard."

09:06.879 --> 09:08.005
It makes sense now.

09:09.090 --> 09:12.468
So he was with you
when my Stand activated.

09:13.094 --> 09:16.472
He had seen my face and heard me
say my name.

09:16.556 --> 09:20.017
Emporio was hiding in the walls of
the confinement cell.

09:20.518 --> 09:22.520
Usually, I'd let him be.

09:23.020 --> 09:28.401
My Jailhouse Lock's job
is to keep Stand Users behind bars.

09:28.484 --> 09:30.403
But if he's trying to leave
a record of me,

09:30.486 --> 09:32.029
then that changes everything.

09:32.113 --> 09:34.282
I now deem you an escapee.

09:40.746 --> 09:45.793
Her Stand, Stone Ocean.
Bullets won't give her a scratch.

09:45.876 --> 09:52.300
But her memory would have been impaired
had I fired four shots.

09:52.383 --> 09:55.052
Her brain wouldn't even register
the fourth shot,

09:55.136 --> 09:59.265
let alone the smoke from it!

09:59.974 --> 10:02.727
Jolyne…

10:03.311 --> 10:05.187
What?

10:05.271 --> 10:08.065
I don't know why there's a room
in a place like this,

10:08.149 --> 10:11.193
and what a little boy is doing here.

10:11.277 --> 10:13.696
But Pale Snake had told me

10:13.779 --> 10:18.117
that Jolyne Cujoh has allies
from the inside who have been helping her

10:18.200 --> 10:20.328
- using walkie-talkies and the like.
- Emporio!

10:20.411 --> 10:22.622
So this little boy was her ally.

10:22.705 --> 10:26.792
And now, any record he had
about me is gone.

10:26.876 --> 10:29.462
I won't forgive you!

10:29.545 --> 10:31.839
Wow, how caring.

10:31.922 --> 10:34.050
But even that anger you feel right now

10:34.133 --> 10:37.928
will be completely forgotten
with the next three pieces of information.

10:38.012 --> 10:40.848
That's my Stand Jailhouse Lock's ability.

10:40.931 --> 10:43.934
Take this. Meet your end, Jolyne Cujoh!

10:48.356 --> 10:51.233
You won't be able to see
more than three of the shots.

10:51.317 --> 10:54.195
The others will leave a hole in your body!

11:06.540 --> 11:10.920
An image reflected on water
is the one whole truth.

11:11.003 --> 11:13.339
You might be able to shoot
many shots at once,

11:13.422 --> 11:16.008
but I can see their reflections
all at once.

11:16.092 --> 11:19.470
I hope you haven't forgotten
about this one.

11:19.553 --> 11:20.846
AVENGE EMPORIO

11:26.394 --> 11:27.311
That bitch…

11:27.812 --> 11:30.147
But I managed to destroy the computer.

11:30.231 --> 11:32.066
Now, I just have to escape.

11:32.733 --> 11:36.028
Jolyne will forget about me soon anyway.

11:36.112 --> 11:38.322
She will never be able to
remember who I am!

11:42.618 --> 11:44.912
Emporio, hang in there
for just a bit longer.

11:44.995 --> 11:46.580
I will go after her.

11:46.664 --> 11:51.043
Don't, Jolyne.

11:51.127 --> 11:54.839
You'll forget everything the moment
you step out of this room.

11:55.423 --> 11:58.467
You'll even forget about defeating her.

11:58.551 --> 11:59.510
So, please…

11:59.593 --> 12:04.306
Emporio, I understand
why you are so careful.

12:04.390 --> 12:08.269
It was a skill you needed to develop
to survive inside these prison walls.

12:09.061 --> 12:12.189
But there comes a time
when we have to move forward,

12:12.773 --> 12:14.775
even if that means facing danger.

12:15.985 --> 12:17.820
And for me,

12:18.737 --> 12:20.156
that time is now!

12:22.992 --> 12:24.201
Is this her string?

12:34.044 --> 12:35.921
STAND NAME: JAILHOUSE LOCK
STAND USER: MEW MEW

12:42.428 --> 12:44.722
Why am I injured?

12:45.973 --> 12:49.101
But there comes a time
when we have to move forward,

12:49.602 --> 12:51.979
even if that means facing danger.

12:52.813 --> 12:54.648
I don't know why…

12:54.732 --> 12:57.985
but I feel like there's something
I have to do…

12:58.694 --> 12:59.695
What was it?

13:01.071 --> 13:03.574
That's right, print it out.

13:03.657 --> 13:05.576
I have to tell Jolyne.

13:06.410 --> 13:07.870
I have to print something out…

13:09.038 --> 13:12.541
but what was I trying to print?

13:13.125 --> 13:16.420
My room doesn't even have a printer.

13:16.504 --> 13:18.380
COMPUTE

13:25.596 --> 13:27.473
She's strong!

13:30.142 --> 13:31.644
She is the enemy I'm after.

13:32.353 --> 13:34.605
I can't let her get away.

13:38.567 --> 13:40.653
I need you back here!

13:40.736 --> 13:42.363
I'm at the D10 stairwell!

13:46.784 --> 13:48.577
Look, she's over there!

13:48.661 --> 13:50.496
Lead Guard Mew Mew is being assaulted!

13:50.579 --> 13:51.413
The gate!

13:51.497 --> 13:52.623
Open the gate!

14:05.886 --> 14:06.804
This place…

14:06.887 --> 14:09.306
Why am I here?

14:11.141 --> 14:14.228
Hurry! Capture her!

14:14.812 --> 14:15.938
Am I…

14:16.564 --> 14:17.398
being chased?

14:20.234 --> 14:22.361
The three guards are here now.

14:22.987 --> 14:27.032
Now, you will never recall that I exist!

14:35.040 --> 14:37.126
Now, try to run away just a little bit.

14:37.209 --> 14:39.587
Then, the guards will shoot you to death.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.339
Before you go, those hands of yours…

14:42.423 --> 14:44.925
I almost forgot that
they can block gunshots.

14:53.267 --> 14:57.354
My duty is strictly to keep
Stand Users confined in this facility.

14:58.397 --> 15:00.983
But I feel great right now.

15:03.777 --> 15:07.281
It feels great to
watch you get shot to death.

15:07.364 --> 15:09.199
Because you brought this upon yourself.

15:09.283 --> 15:13.245
You wanted to walk out of your line,
so this is what you get.

15:13.329 --> 15:14.163
There she is.

15:14.246 --> 15:20.377
And I love that you can't see
more than three guards!

15:20.961 --> 15:23.505
- I've found her!
- There she is!

15:23.589 --> 15:27.676
No one can escape my Jailhouse Lock!

15:32.306 --> 15:33.140
Jolyne…

15:33.223 --> 15:34.516
How long have you been here?

15:35.017 --> 15:37.269
Emporio, it's you!

15:37.353 --> 15:38.646
I have to tell you…

15:38.729 --> 15:41.982
I have to print this out for you.

15:42.066 --> 15:44.360
If I don't, you won't be able to
remember her.

15:44.443 --> 15:45.736
Print it out?

15:46.487 --> 15:47.821
Binaries.

15:47.905 --> 15:50.032
These are binaries made up
of ones and zeroes.

15:50.115 --> 15:51.867
I must have computed this.

15:51.951 --> 15:55.371
You can print it correctly.

15:55.454 --> 15:58.999
We are going to imprint it
into your memory!

15:59.833 --> 16:02.586
Stone Ocean!

16:09.218 --> 16:10.636
They're binary numbers.

16:10.719 --> 16:13.305
The binary system can express anything.

16:13.889 --> 16:17.017
Draw zeroes and ones using your thread.

16:17.601 --> 16:18.811
You can use Stone Ocean

16:18.894 --> 16:21.522
as a printer that can express images!

16:28.278 --> 16:30.990
Can I consider you my enemy?

16:31.073 --> 16:33.117
Are you an enemy?

16:33.200 --> 16:34.243
What?

16:36.245 --> 16:37.287
She's talking nonsense.

16:37.871 --> 16:39.248
She can't even see me.

16:39.748 --> 16:42.084
Now, be gone.

16:42.876 --> 16:47.756
Thanks. So I guess
you are an enemy after all.

16:55.889 --> 16:57.808
What's happening?

16:59.226 --> 17:01.520
She has Mew Mew hostage!

17:01.603 --> 17:02.896
Emporio.

17:02.980 --> 17:06.608
Her Jailhouse Lock is no longer active.

17:07.276 --> 17:09.862
Yes. I'm okay now.

17:09.945 --> 17:12.906
Great. I'm leaving now.

17:12.990 --> 17:15.868
Like I told you before,
I'm leaving this prison.

17:16.827 --> 17:18.287
What are you going to do?

17:18.370 --> 17:22.416
If you plan on staying here,
then you should go back to your room.

17:28.297 --> 17:31.341
Jolyne, my time to leave is now.

17:31.842 --> 17:33.218
I…

17:33.302 --> 17:35.095
I want to see the outside world!

17:37.389 --> 17:39.516
Look, a child.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.685
Why is there a child in prison?

17:41.769 --> 17:43.771
Either way, keep your guard up!

17:54.031 --> 17:56.408
Come, Emporio. Let's go.

17:57.326 --> 17:59.578
Excuse me.

18:00.162 --> 18:02.790
Sorry, coming through.

18:06.293 --> 18:08.629
Sorry, excuse me.

18:11.173 --> 18:14.551
What? Who was I trying to gun down?

18:14.635 --> 18:18.430
- What am I doing here?
- Why am I here?

18:19.598 --> 18:21.391
Great job, Mew Mew.

18:21.475 --> 18:23.268
I'm glad you understand.

18:23.936 --> 18:28.440
First, we are going to the medical wing
to treat Emporio's wound.

18:29.316 --> 18:32.236
I'm counting on you to keep us safe,
Jailhouse Lock.

18:32.736 --> 18:35.572
An undefeated ability
that restricts the enemy's memory.

18:38.784 --> 18:40.410
Where… am I?

18:46.583 --> 18:48.335
Do you have my father's disc?

18:48.418 --> 18:50.879
Yes. I've had it with me the entire time.

18:50.963 --> 18:52.631
Hey, Jolyne!

18:53.423 --> 18:55.050
It's Jolyne.

18:55.134 --> 18:56.301
Emporio, you too.

18:56.385 --> 18:57.511
Ermes.

19:00.556 --> 19:04.810
I heard a commotion.
I knew it had to be you guys.

19:05.811 --> 19:06.854
Who is she?

19:06.937 --> 19:08.981
She is this prison's lead guard.

19:09.481 --> 19:10.315
What?

19:10.816 --> 19:12.609
Does that mean you're…

19:12.693 --> 19:16.613
Yes. We are breaking out.
We're about to leave this place.

19:18.365 --> 19:19.658
You're going after that priest.

19:19.741 --> 19:21.160
That's right, Ermes.

19:21.952 --> 19:26.623
I have to seal what he took.
I'm ready for anything.

19:27.958 --> 19:30.294
Things even worse than
what we faced in this prison.

19:37.217 --> 19:38.969
Take me with you then.

20:30.938 --> 20:34.816
Father, thank you.

20:34.900 --> 20:37.194
I don't mean to be rude,
but are you feeling okay?

20:37.277 --> 20:40.155
Yes, I'm just a little tired.

20:47.287 --> 20:48.580
Are you… sure?

20:52.125 --> 20:53.502
Excuse me.

21:02.678 --> 21:04.763
What is this?

21:08.058 --> 21:10.560
What's wrong with these eggs?

21:12.312 --> 21:13.647
A Stand…

21:13.730 --> 21:18.860
Pale Snake is no longer my Stand ability.

21:19.486 --> 21:22.614
Something else is inside me… but what?

21:23.198 --> 21:25.158
I feel terrible…

21:25.242 --> 21:28.620
Something is running loose inside me.

21:29.121 --> 21:32.582
This power, it's beyond my control.

21:33.333 --> 21:35.836
But this power carries hope.

21:35.919 --> 21:39.339
I can at least feel
hope within this power.

21:39.423 --> 21:42.968
Dio's memo inside Jotaro's memory…

21:43.552 --> 21:46.930
It seems this power needs
the things in that memory.

21:47.014 --> 21:48.682
Time and place.

21:49.933 --> 21:52.269
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes.

21:52.352 --> 21:54.855
West longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

21:55.355 --> 21:58.275
That's where heaven will be.

21:59.276 --> 22:02.654
This location is Cape Canaveral.

22:02.738 --> 22:04.698
Kennedy Space Center.

22:09.036 --> 22:10.704
It will be during the new moon.

22:11.204 --> 22:12.664
Six more days.

23:41.294 --> 23:46.299
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
